<Base title="About QuietPDF" description="QuietPDF is a free set of PDF tools that run entirely in your browser, with no uploads and no signup.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About QuietPDF</h1>
    <p>QuietPDF is a free set of PDF tools that run entirely in your browser. No uploads, no signup, no watermarks, and it keeps working offline once loaded.</p>
    <p>More about how it is built is coming soon.</p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 42rem;
    padding: var(--space-4) 0;
  }
</style>
